# Google Analytics 4 (GA4) & Microsoft Clarity Configuration
# Completely free, private visitor analytics for your portfolio.

# 1. Google Analytics 4 (GA4) - Free Standard Version
# Create a free property at https://analytics.google.com/
# Go to Admin -> Data Streams -> Web -> copy your Measurement ID (format: G-XXXXXXXXXX)
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# 2. Microsoft Clarity - Free Standard Version (Session Recordings & Heatmaps)
# Create a free project at https://clarity.microsoft.com/
# Go to Settings -> Overview -> copy your Project ID (alphanumeric code)
VITE_CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=
